B.aq1=new A.q("PadCare is a free, community-centered humanitarian platform.\n\n1. Acceptance: By using PadCare, you agree to access emergency and educational menstrual hygiene support with integrity.\n\n2. Non-Commercial: Supplies dispensed through PadCare (reusable kits and disposable packs) are donated for schoolgirls and community members and are not for resale.\n\n3. Respect & Safety: Users, teachers, and guardians must respect the confidentiality and dignity of all students.\n\n4. Modifications: PadCare reserves the right to update features, distribution points, and policies to improve community welfare.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
